# Dotfiles — new apps & restore

When adding or installing software in this repo:

1. Install the package (`pacman` / user-run `yay` if password needed).
2. Refresh inventory: `./packages/export.sh` or `dotfiles-register-app <pkg>`.
3. Stow any durable config under the correct package; update `restow.sh` if new package.
4. If themable, add a `theme/.../templates` entry and wire `theme-render`.
5. Never commit secrets (tokens, browser profiles, OBS websocket password, SSH keys).
6. Commit/push only when the user asks.

Full restore for humans: `./bootstrap.sh` (see `RESTORE.md`, `AGENTS.md`).
